          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-slate-800 bg-[#0d1322] rounded-xl p-5">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-cyan-400 uppercase font-mono mb-1">Trap 3: Bundled Auditor Markups</h3>
